<!--
  ShadowStrikePhantomUI.vcxproj
  =============================
  Qt 6 / QML desktop client for ShadowStrike Phantom Home.

  Requires:
    - Qt 6.7 LTS MSVC build (default path: C:\Qt\6.7.3\msvc2019_64)
      Override via environment variable  Qt6_ROOT  if installed elsewhere.

  MOC + RCC are invoked via <CustomBuild> so this project has no runtime
  dependency on the Qt VSAddin. Header-based Q_OBJECT emitters must be
  listed under <QtMoc> below.

  The EXE statically embeds all QML assets through qml.qrc, so the shipped
  binary has zero loose QML files.
-->
